      {
        "id": "model-conditional-edge-scope",
        "moduleId": "edges",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "路由函数与节点的职责边界",
        "markdown": "路由函数只做一件事：读状态、返回一个目标节点的名字。它不执行任务、不修改状态、不产生副作用——那些都属于节点。反过来，节点也不该偷偷决定下一站，否则图结构与实际执行就会脱节。把“做什么”和“去哪”分开，图才是可读、可追踪、可画的。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-edges-routing"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-stategraph-build",
        "moduleId": "assembly",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "StateGraph：装配与编译",
        "markdown": "**StateGraph（状态图）** 是包含整个智能体工作流的容器。教材用四步把前面三个概念装起来：\n\n```python\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph, START, END\n\nbuilder = StateGraph(State)\nbuilder.add_node(\"node_1\", node_1)\nbuilder.add_node(\"node_2\", node_2)\nbuilder.add_node(\"node_3\", node_3)\n\nbuilder.add_edge(START, \"node_1\")\nbuilder.add_conditional_edges(\"node_1\", decide_mood)\nbuilder.add_edge(\"node_2\", END)\nbuilder.add_edge(\"node_3\", END)\n\ngraph = builder.compile()\n```\n\n依次是：用 `State` 类型构造容器、用 `add_node` 注册节点、用 `add_edge` 与 `add_conditional_edges` 连线、最后 `compile()` 得到可运行的图。编译之后还可以把它画出来检查结构：\n\n```python\ndisplay(Image(graph.get_graph().draw_mermaid_png()))\n```",
